<title>USA: Financial Security Q4 earnings per share rise.</title>
<headline>Financial Security Q4 earnings per share rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>				 Three months ended    Year ended</p>
<p>				     December 31	 December 31</p>
<p>				   1996    1995	1996     1995</p>
<p>Total revenues		48,344  35,521   158,998   127,273</p>
<p>Net income		    25,258   8,477    80,760    55,038</p>
<p>Ave shrs			29,975  25,610    30,547    25,797</p>
<p>Earnings per common share   0.83    0.33	2.64	2.13</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Financial Security Assurance</p>
<p>Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- (New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610)</p>
